  "adm1.acc.restored": ["Standardkonten (KMU-Kontenrahmen) wiederhergestellt.", "Comptes standard (plan comptable PME) rétablis.", "Conti standard (piano contabile PMI) ripristinati.", "Default accounts (SME chart of accounts) restored."],
